            "english": "It is cold, and it is raining too."
          },
          {
            "speaker": "A",
            "hanzi": "那只猫在外边吗？",
            "pinyin": "Nà zhī māo zài wàibian ma?",
            "english": "Is that cat outside?"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "B",
            "hanzi": "不在，它在家里。",
            "pinyin": "Bú zài, tā zài jiā lǐ.",
            "english": "No, it is at home."
          }
        ]
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "id": "pattern-1",
          "title": "Describing weather",
          "explanation_en": "Use 天气 (tiānqì) for the weather, then an adjective or weather event. 下雨 (xià yǔ) functions as “to rain”; do not translate it word-for-word as “down rain”.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "hanzi": "今天天气很热。",
              "pinyin": "Jīntiān tiānqì hěn rè.",
              "english": "The weather is hot today."
            },
            {
              "hanzi": "明天可能下雨。",
              "pinyin": "Míngtiān kěnéng xià yǔ.",
              "english": "It may rain tomorrow."
            }
          ],
          "pattern_hanzi": "今天 + 天气 + 很 + 形容词 / 今天 + 下雨",
          "pattern_pinyin": "jīntiān + tiānqì + hěn + xíngróngcí / jīntiān + xiàyǔ",
          "pattern_pseudo_translation": "今天 + 天气 + 很 + <adjective> / 今天 + 下雨"
        },
        {
          "id": "pattern-2",
          "title": "Talking about animal location",
          "explanation_en": "在 (zài) locates the subject. The animal classifier 只 (zhī) introduces an individual cat or dog.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "hanzi": "这只狗在房间里。",
              "pinyin": "Zhè zhī gǒu zài fángjiān lǐ.",
              "english": "This dog is in the room."
            },
            {
              "hanzi": "猫在桌子下边。",
              "pinyin": "Māo zài zhuōzi xiàbian.",
              "english": "The cat is under the table."
            }
          ],
          "pattern_hanzi": "[那/这] + 只 + 动物 + 在 + 地点",
          "pattern_pinyin": "[nà/zhè] + zhī + dòngwù + zài + dìdiǎn",
          "pattern_pseudo_translation": "[那/这] + 只 + <animal> + 在 + <place>"
        }
      ],
      "guided_building": {
        "instruction_en": "Change the weather description, not the sentence structure.",
        "model": {
